      "id": "M21",
      "title_zh": "知识与生活：相连的哲学候选",
      "title_en": "Knowing and living: connected philosophical proposal",
      "claim_zh": "认识、纠正与模型修订构成相连候选。G0下意识分化生的意义，新的生也可有正面意义且不自动产生特定义务。保存已有生活能够要求实际更新；更强争点是超出既有请求与保存目标的新实现。整体改名不能隐去毁损，拒绝福利性创造理由不等于否定全部生成根据。 有条件的照护不独自穷尽生成理由，排除其他正面根据须另有辩护。 完整历史中的混合改善与正当重新分配可导出新的生的正面比较；先后评价须有明确传递。 完整排序不是基本正面意义的新增门槛；新生的正面理由与具体行动要求分别说明。 生的意义不以调节成功或自足为门槛；依存中的生活与局部成功的整体后果分别保留。 意识比较完成两问：福利限制不独自穷尽伦理意义，感觉改变须重评，不能自动保留或抹去全部价值。 探究目的检验区分正确性、探究理由与更广生活根据；理解可以本身值得实现，但使用科学不独自驳倒对 G0 的范围限制。 共同生活根据检验说明 G0 与 J1/J4 能在无反向损失且正当可行时支持非意识生活的继续；条件性选择差异不反过来证明公理。 理由权威检验即使承认客观实践理由，仍须解释其具体内容为何涵盖 G0 的生的范围；保留目的修订及可错纠正的正面账户。 具体理由比较完成照护、理解、正当承担及进一步生的接通；共同根据不要求价值独占，关系中的好可以本身值得实现。 福利边界检验允许意识福利与更广生的基本意义并存；比较优先不抹去被舍弃的真实好，争议转向福利是否穷尽全部基本伦理根据。 福利排他论比较完成：实际的好不等于新增改善或义务；无意识生的概念比较定位根据分歧，反驳一种排他论不独自证明G0及全部附加承诺的唯一必然。 繁盛肯定论证进一步区分生物表现、基本意义与整体选择：完整繁盛不是生的意义门槛，繁殖和典型性不是整体好坏的充分判准。 相容性纠正恢复原目标：不要求唯一表述或实际赞同；明确排除生的基本意义才构成相应冲突。 实践权威检验复用已完成责任原则：一时意愿改变不独自解除正当承担；认识理由的权威不自动完成实践权威。 本轮将可错科学辨别的必要条件接入实查：作答覆盖受两侧错误和可用区别共同约束，适应关系可跨不同内部状态接续。",
      "claim_en": "Knowing, correction and model revision form a connected account. Under G0, consciousness differentiates living significance and new living can count positively without assigning a specific duty. Preservation can require renewal; the sharper dispute concerns new realization beyond incumbent claims and preservation targets. Redescription cannot erase destruction, and rejecting a welfare-based creation reason does not reject every generative ground. Conditional care does not independently exhaust formation reasons; excluding a further favorable ground needs its own defense. Whole-history mixed improvement and warranted reallocation yield favorable formation; stage-relative judgments need explicit transport. A complete ordering is not an additional gate for basic positive significance; favorable formation reasons and practical requirements retain distinct grounds. Living significance is not awarded for regulatory success or self-sufficiency; dependent living and the whole consequences of local success remain in view. The consciousness comparison closes the two questions: a welfare restriction alone does not exhaust ethical significance, and changed feeling requires reassessment without automatic retention or erasure of all value. The inquiry-purpose test distinguishes correctness, reasons to inquire and wider living grounds; understanding can itself be worth realizing, but using science alone does not refute a restriction of G0. The common-living-ground test shows how G0/J1/J4 can favor nonconscious living continuation under no-loss and legitimate-feasibility conditions; that conditional difference does not prove the axiom. The reason-authority test grants objective practical reasons while requiring an explanation of why their content reaches G0 living scope; purpose revision and fallible correction retain their positive roles. The completed reason-content comparison connects care, understanding, legitimate undertakings and further living; a common ground need not exhaust all value, and relational goods can matter for their own sake. The welfare-boundary test permits conscious welfare alongside wider basic living significance; comparative priority preserves foregone good, and the dispute concerns whether welfare exhausts basic ethical grounds. The welfare-exhaustion comparison distinguishes realized good, marginal improvement and duty; nonconscious living locates a substantive ground dispute, while rejecting one restriction does not uniquely establish G0 or every additional commitment. The affirmative flourishing test distinguishes biological performance, basic significance and whole choice: complete flourishing is not an admission threshold, and reproduction or typicality does not independently determine whole goodness. The restored target requires compatibility, without demanding a unique formulation or actual assent; explicit exclusion of basic living significance supplies the corresponding conflict. The practical-authority test reuses completed responsibility principles: changed inclination alone does not discharge a justified undertaking, and epistemic authority does not automatically establish practical authority. This continuation checks a necessary condition of fallible scientific discrimination: coverage is constrained by the two error weights and available distinctions, with adaptive correspondence across different internal states.",
      "scope_zh": "两个范围问题在G0/J下的完成保留；扩读Frick的接续价值论，新增Finneron-Burns原典检验保存对象的界定，纠正过粗的对手归类。无新定理、实验或独立验收；整套理论必要性、最广组织范围及普遍意识／语义仍未证。继承界面相容8／11、一般相容13／18、模型修订30／72及76次执行、来源26／53、选择性修订16／32与四项统计复核原范围；完成的实践与对齐方向不重开。 新增Aaron原典批评与作者反审，信用既有时间与排序分析；批评限制不等于证明相反公理。 生成序列新增6项Lean定理／13项空依赖审计；有限诊断只检验较弱推论，不证明完整对手或G0。 本轮Chappell与Dorr–Nebel–Zuehl原典检验强化正面论证与实质反审；两个G0回答保持完成，无新定理、编译或实验，普遍必要性仍未证。 Bruckner与Dussault原典及依存反审强化非感知范围候选，不把充分根据误作必要条件；无新证明或普遍必要性结论。 Cecchinato、Gottlieb等与Shepherd原典评估保留 G0/J/E 的明确根据；有心灵不等于涵盖全部生命，无新证明或整套理论必要性结论。 Friedman与Kauppinen原典比较保留认识规范及非工具认知价值；共同伦理根据仍需跨范围辩护，无新证明或普遍必要性结论。 Goodpaster与Benatar原典比较保留生物利益与独立伦理根据的分歧；两个回答已完成，整套理论的科学必要性未证，无新定理或实验。 Vesper与McPherson/Plunkett原典比较区分实践必要性、认识根据与具体伦理内容；没有新增规范存在证明、G0必然性或数学定理。 Korsgaard限定页码与Scanlon章节原典比较支持区分；两个G0/J/E回答已完成，非意识生的基本意义仍是实质分歧，未新增定理或整套必要性证明。 核读Chalmers与Lee作者稿并保留版本和范围；未将非意识福利证明加为G0门槛，没有新增定理、经验验证或整套必要性证明。 核读Bramble完整稿及Routley原文第1至2节，复用已有Bader评估；思想实验非经验发现，两个公理回答保持完成，没有新增证明或整套必要性结论。 核读Kallhoff完整作者稿并保留维管植物范围；McShane仅摘要和注释、其他访问限制明示。两个公理回答保持完成，无新增证明或经验验证，普遍必要性未证。 动机与享受的来源检验限制经验替代推断，不证明伦理排他性或普遍相容性。两个 G0/J/E 回答保持完成；无新定理或实验。 核读 Joyce 2019 全文主要章节与注释；其他新线索仅摘要／作者介绍。累积论证不把共同前提重复计证；整套相容性未证，无新增定理或实验。 本次18项新形式定理／27项审计支持有限自然权重范围，信用既有统计方法；不是18项独立发现。完整核心的科学普遍必要性仍开放。",
      "scope_en": "The two G0/J scope answers remain complete. Extended Frick reading and a new Finneron-Burns comparison sharpen the preservation target and correct an overly broad rival classification. No new theorem, experiment or independent acceptance. Whole-theory necessity, the broadest organizational scope and universal consciousness/semantics remain unproved. Inherited profile compatibility 8/11, general compatibility 13/18, model revision 30/72 and 76 runs, source reliance 26/53, selective revision 16/32 and four-statistic checks retain their scopes; completed practical and alignment arguments are reused. New Aaron primary criticism and author counterreview credit the prior temporal and ordering analyses; criticism of a restriction does not prove the opposite axiom. Formation sequence adds 6 Lean theorems/13 empty dependency audits; the finite diagnostic tests a weaker inference, not a full ethical rival or G0. This round’s Chappell and Dorr–Nebel–Zuehl primary assessments strengthen the affirmative argument and substantive counterreview; the two G0 answers remain complete, with no new theorem, compilation or experiment and no universal-necessity proof. Bruckner and Dussault primary assessments and the dependence counterreview strengthen the nonsentient-scope candidate without confusing sufficient grounds with necessary conditions; no new proof or universal-necessity conclusion. Primary assessments of Cecchinato, Gottlieb and colleagues, and Shepherd retain explicit G0/J/E grounds; mentality does not cover all living, and no new proof or full-theory necessity follows. Friedman and Kauppinen primary comparisons retain epistemic norms and noninstrumental cognitive value; the common ethical ground still needs scope justification, with no new proof or universal-necessity conclusion. Goodpaster and Benatar primary comparisons distinguish biological interests from independent ethical grounds; the two answers remain complete, with full-theory scientific necessity unproved and no new theorem or experiment. Vesper and McPherson/Plunkett primary comparisons distinguish practical indispensability, epistemic warrant and ethical content; no new proof of normative existence, G0 necessity or mathematical theorem is claimed. Bounded Korsgaard pages and the Scanlon chapter inform the distinctions; the two G0/J/E answers remain complete, basic significance for nonconscious living remains a substantive dispute, and no new theorem or full-theory necessity proof is claimed. Chalmers and Lee author manuscripts are assessed with version and scope limits; proving nonconscious welfare is not added as a G0 prerequisite, and no new theorem, empirical validation or full-theory necessity proof is claimed. The complete Bramble manuscript and Routley sections 1–2 are assessed, reusing the prior Bader review; the conceptual comparison is not empirical evidence, the two axiomatic answers remain complete, and no new proof or full-theory necessity result is claimed. The complete Kallhoff author manuscript is assessed within its vascular-plant scope; McShane access is limited to abstract and notes, with other limits recorded. The two axiomatic answers remain complete; no new proof, empirical validation or universal necessity is claimed. The motivation/enjoyment source test limits empirical proxy inference without proving ethical exclusivity or universal compatibility. Both G0/J/E answers remain complete; no new theorem or experiment. Joyce 2019 main text and notes are assessed; other new leads remain at abstract/author-summary scope. Cumulative support does not double-count shared premises; full compatibility remains unproved, with no new theorem or experiment. This round adds 18 formal theorems / 27 audits for finite natural weights, crediting established statistics; these are not 18 independent discoveries. Science-wide necessity of the full core remains open.",
